[20.900731, "o", "\r\n🤔 Consulting the chef...\r\n"]
[40.07947, "o", "=> Ingredients needed: pizza dough (1pc), tomato passata (or crushed tomatoes) (150ml), fresh mozzarella (150g), fresh basil leaves (8pc), pepperoni (sliced) (80g), mushrooms (sliced) (80g), red bell pepper (1pc), red onion (1pc), black olives (pitted, sliced) (50g)\r\n\r\n🛒 Searching database for cheapest products...\r\n   Searching for 'pizza dough'... "]
[40.135336, "o", "Found: Hard grated cheese \"Zanetti Grana Padano\" 50g (880.00)\r\n   Searching for 'tomato passata (or crushed tomatoes)'... "]
[40.165185, "o", "Found: Red Grape (570.00)\r\n   Searching for 'fresh mozzarella'... "]
[40.176645, "o", "Found: Yeremyan cheese mozzarella in brine 140g (880.00)\r\n   Searching for 'fresh basil leaves'... "]
[40.194262, "o", "Found: Poppy seeds \"Zolotoe Testo\" 20g (430.00)\r\n   Searching for 'pepperoni (sliced)'... "]
[40.217236, "o", "Found: Chips Dr. Korner pepper and chili 50g (430.00)\r\n   Searching for 'mushrooms (sliced)'... "]
[40.320963, "o", "Found: Mushrooms Top San whole 425ml (530.00)\r\n   Searching for 'red bell pepper'... "]
[40.512708, "o", "Found: Red pen \"Cello Finegrip\" (90.00)\r\n   Searching for 'red onion'... "]
[40.538143, "o", "Found: Carrot Local (300.00)\r\n   Searching for 'black olives (pitted, sliced)'... "]
[40.670371, "o", "Found: Black olives Don olive 1020g (2580.00)\r\n\r\n📋 Generating Shopping List...\r\n\r\nFinal prompt:\r\n\r\n    I decided to cook: Pizza Margarita with extras added on top.\r\n    \r\n    Here is the result of my product search for ingredients:\r\n    [\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"pizza dough\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"1\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"pc\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Hard grated cheese \\\"Zanetti Grana Padano\\\" 50g\",\r\n    \"price\": \"880.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://www.sas.am/en/catalog/importnyy_syr/7925/\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"tomato passata (or crushed tomatoes)\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"150\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"ml\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Red Grape\",\r\n    \"price\": \"570.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://carrefour.am/en/red-grape\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"fresh mozzarella\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"150\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"g\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Yeremyan cheese mozzarella in brine 140g\",\r\n    \"price\": \"880.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://carrefour.am/en/yeremyan-cheese-mozzarella-in-brine-140g\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"fresh basil leaves\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"8\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"pc\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Poppy seeds \\\"Zolotoe Testo\\\" 20g\",\r\n    \"price\": \"430.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://www.sas.am/en/catalog/spicess/308766/\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"pepperoni (sliced)\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"80\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"g\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Chips Dr. Korner pepper and chili 50g\",\r\n    \"price\": \"430.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://carrefour.am/en/chips-dr-korner-pepper-and-chili-50g\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"mushrooms (sliced)\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"80\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"g\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Mushrooms Top San whole 425ml\",\r\n    \"price\": \"530.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://carrefour.am/en/mushrooms-top-san-whole-425ml\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"red bell pepper\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"1\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"pc\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Red pen \\\"Cello Finegrip\\\"\",\r\n    \"price\": \"90.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://www.sas.am/en/catalog/ruchka_karandash/5908/\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"red onion\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"1\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"pc\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Carrot Local\",\r\n    \"price\": \"300.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://carrefour.am/en/carrot\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"ingredient\": \"black olives (pitted, sliced)\",\r\n    \"quantity\": \"50\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"g\",\r\n    \"product_title\": \"Black olives Don olive 1020g\",\r\n    \"price\": \"2580.00\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://carrefour.am/en/black-olives-don-olive-1020g\"\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n    \r\n    Please present this to the user as a nice shopping list. \r\n    - Group items if logical.\r\n    - Show the exact product to buy and its price.\r\n    - If an item wasn't found, suggest where to look or a substitute.\r\n    - Calculate and display the subtotal for the found items.\r\n    - Add a specialized tip for cooking this specific dish.\r\n    \r\n"]
[94.654223, "o", "\r\nHere’s a tidy, actionable shopping list based on your search results — grouped logically, showing the exact product found (with price & link), noting mismatches, and giving suggestions where an ingredient wasn’t found. Prices are shown as listed (AMD).\r\n\r\nCheese & dairy\r\n- Fresh mozzarella — needed 150 g  \r\n  Product: Yeremyan cheese mozzarella in brine 140 g — 880.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://carrefour.am/en/yeremyan-cheese-mozzarella-in-brine-140g  \r\n  Note: 140 g is slightly under 150 g but close. Drain and pat dry well before using to avoid a soggy pizza.\r\n\r\n- (Extra) Hard grated cheese — useful as a finishing topping (optional)  \r\n  Product: Zanetti Grana Padano, 50 g — 880.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://www.sas.am/en/catalog/importnyy_syr/7925/  \r\n  Note: This product appeared in the “pizza dough” slot in your search — it’s not dough, but it’s a fine extra to grate over the pizza after baking.\r\n\r\nProduce\r\n- Fresh basil leaves — needed ~8 pcs  \r\n  Product found: Poppy seeds \"Zolotoe Testo\" 20 g — 430.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://www.sas.am/en/catalog/spicess/308766/  \r\n  Note: This product does NOT match basil. Where to look / substitution: buy fresh basil in the produce/herbs section (or use a small jar of pesto or dried basil — use much less if dried: ~1 tsp).\r\n\r\n- Red bell pepper — needed 1 pc  \r\n  Product found: Red pen \"Cello Finegrip\" — 90.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://www.sas.am/en/catalog/ruchka_karandash/5908/  \r\n  Note: The pen is not the ingredient. Get a fresh red bell pepper from the produce aisle (or use roasted red pepper from a jar).\r\n\r\n- Red onion — needed 1 pc  \r\n  Product found: Carrot Local — 300.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://carrefour.am/en/carrot  \r\n  Note: Carrot is not the red onion. Pick up a fresh red onion in produce (or use a small white/yellow onion if needed).\r\n\r\nCanned / jarred & sauces\r\n- Tomato passata (or crushed tomatoes) — needed 150 ml  \r\n  Product found: \"Red Grape\" — 570.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://carrefour.am/en/red-grape  \r\n  Note: This product does NOT match passata. Look in the canned tomatoes / pasta sauce aisle for passata or crushed tomatoes (brands: Mutti, Cirio, Carrefour own brand). Crushed whole tomatoes or pizza sauce are fine substitutes.\r\n\r\n- Mushrooms (sliced) — needed 80 g  \r\n  Product: Mushrooms Top San whole 425 ml — 530.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://carrefour.am/en/mushrooms-top-san-whole-425ml  \r\n  Note: This is canned whole mushrooms — slice/drain as needed. Matches the ingredient (you’ll use less than the jar).\r\n\r\nMeat & deli / extras\r\n- Pepperoni (sliced) — needed 80 g  \r\n  Product found: Chips Dr. Korner pepper and chili 50 g — 430.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://carrefour.am/en/chips-dr-korner-pepper-and-chili-50g  \r\n  Note: Chips are not pepperoni. Look in the deli/charcuterie or packaged salami section for sliced pepperoni or spicy salami (or use thinly sliced soppressata, chorizo, or cooked ham if pepperoni is unavailable).\r\n\r\n- Black olives (pitted, sliced) — needed 50 g  \r\n  Product: Black olives Don olive 1020 g — 2,580.00 AMD  \r\n  Link: https://carrefour.am/en/black-olives-don-olive-1020g  \r\n  Note: Large jar — fine to buy and store. Use about 50 g for your pizza; keep the rest refrigerated in brine.\r\n\r\nSubtotal (only ingredients that matched your requested item)\r\n- Matched items included and summed:\r\n  - Fresh mozzarella: 880.00 AMD\r\n  - Mushrooms (canned): 530.00 AMD\r\n  - Black olives (jar): 2,580.00 AMD\r\n  Matched subtotal: 3,990.00 AMD\r\n\r\nGrand total if you bought every product listed in your search (including mismatches): 6,690.00 AMD\r\n\r\nQuick suggestions for the missing/wrong items\r\n- Pizza dough: buy fresh pizza dough from the bakery/frozen section or a pre-baked pizza base; look for “pizza dough” or “pizza base” in-store. Quick home substitute: use naan, pita, or make a simple dough (flour, water, yeast, salt, olive oil).\r\n- Tomato passata: look in canned tomatoes/ sauces aisle (Mutti, Cirio, Carrefour brands), or use crushed tomatoes or pizza sauce.\r\n- Basil: fresh from produce; add leaves after b"]
[94.654361, "o", "aking to preserve flavor.\r\n- Pepperoni: deli / cured meats shelf; substitute spicy salami or chorizo if needed.\r\n- Red bell pepper & red onion: pick fresh in produce.\r\n\r\nSpecialized cooking tip for Pizza Margherita with extras\r\n- Bake very hot and fast: preheat your oven (or pizza stone) to the highest temperature possible (250–300 °C if available). Stretch the dough thin, spread a thin layer of passata (lightly seasoned), add drained mozzarella (pat dry to avoid excess moisture), then arrange extras sparingly so the pizza cooks evenly. Bake until crust is blistered and cheese melted (4–10 minutes in very hot oven). Add whole basil leaves and a drizzle of good olive oil right after baking — fresh basil should be added post-bake to keep its aroma and color.\r\n\r\nIf you want, I can:\r\n- Replace the “not found” items with direct product suggestions (links) for pizza dough, passata, fresh basil, and pepperoni from Carrefour or sas.am, and recalc the full shopping total; or\r\n- Create an optimized shopping cart (only matched items + recommended substitutes). Which would you prefer?\r\n"]
